{
  "id": "772",
  "title": "Half an Hour Late",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-11-24",
  "synopsis": "Little He is worried about being late for a meeting.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/772/ca2b7bdf86d683280cd6f08fc81d0cf21f8740d9.mp3?1573478574",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "晚到半小时\n\n小何：下午3点的会议，你参加吗？\n小张：参加啊，你呢？\n小何：我也要参加。但是，长城公司的陈总刚才打电话来，要我下午两点和他见面。\n小张：3点的会议，只有1个小时，你是怕赶不回来，是吗？\n小何：没错！所以我可能会晚到半小时。\n小张：好的，没关系！我会和王经理说的。\n小何：谢谢你！",
    "traditional": "晚到半小時\n\n小何：下午3點的會議，你參加嗎？\n小張：參加啊，你呢？\n小何：我也要參加。但是，長城公司的陳總剛才打電話來，要我下午兩點和他見面。\n小張：3點的會議，只有1個小時，你是怕趕不回來，是嗎？\n小何：沒錯！所以我可能會晚到半小時。\n小張：好的，沒關係！我會和王經理說的。\n小何：謝謝你！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "To Arrive Half an Hour Late"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：下午3点的会议，你参加吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：下午3點的會議，你參加嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé xià wǔ 1 diǎn de huì yì nǐ cān jiā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: The meeting at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, are you joining that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：参加啊，你呢？",
      "traditional": "小張：參加啊，你呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng cān jiā a nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes, I’m joining, how about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：我也要参加。",
      "traditional": "小何：我也要參加。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ yě yào cān jiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "但是，长城公司的陈总刚才打电话来，",
      "traditional": "但是，長城公司的陳總剛才打電話來，",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì cháng chéng gōng sī de chén zǒng gāng cái dǎ diàn huà lái",
      "english": "Little He: I’m joining too."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "要我下午两点和他见面。",
      "traditional": "要我下午兩點和他見面。",
      "pinyin": "yào wǒ xià wǔ liǎng diǎn hé tā jiàn miàn",
      "english": "But, the Great Wall company chief Chen called here a moment ago, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. and wanted me to meet with him at two o’clock in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：3点的会议，只有1个小时，",
      "traditional": "小張：3點的會議，只有1個小時，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng 1 diǎn de huì yì zhǐ yǒu 1 ge xiǎo shí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "你是怕赶不回来，是吗？",
      "traditional": "你是怕趕不回來，是嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ shì pà gǎn bù huí lái shì ma",
      "english": "Little Zhang: The meeting is at 3 o'clock, so you only have one hour."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You’re afraid you won’t make it back in time, is that it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小何：没错！所以我可能会晚到半小时。",
      "traditional": "小何：沒錯！所以我可能會晚到半小時。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé méi cuò suǒ yǐ wǒ kě néng huì wǎn dào bàn xiǎo shí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: That’s right! As a result, I will probably arrive half an hour late."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小张：好的，没关系！我会和王经理说的。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的，沒關係！我會和王經理說的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de méi guān xi wǒ huì hé wáng jīng lǐ shuō de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: OK, never mind! I will talk to manager Wang."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小何：谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "小何：謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Thank you!"
    }
  ],
